{
  "about": "Tab bringing each control into view (sample/ScrollProbe.tsx; docs/adr/0039-keyboard-access.mdx, decision 1), as Android's ScrollView.requestChildFocus does for each scroll view a focused control is in: at once, by the least move that shows it with its focus ring (5 round it, on the display's pixels), one scroll event each, never past the content's end, and no scrollbar shown (a Mac's does not as Tab moves). A sheet (a Modal inside the main list in the tree) opened from the keyboard scrolls nothing behind it as Tab goes through it. Tab down the list's rows, along the chips (a scroll view in a scroll view: each brings it into view, the list the chips' row, which clips the ring) to the last row; then, with the chips and the list moved back by Home, Shift+Tab to the last chip brings it in through both. at 1.",
  "module": "ScrollProbe",
  "window": [
    640,
    400
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "Tab: field, already in view: nothing scrolls",
      "do": [
        "key",
        15
      ],
      "expect": {
        "react": {
          "focus@field": 1,
          "selectionChange@field": [
            1,
            2
          ]
        },
        "scroll_offset": {},
        "keyboard_focus": {
          "target": "field",
          "ring": true
        },
        "scrollbars": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Shift+Tab: round to the last control, outside",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          42,
          15
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "react": {
          "blur@field": 1,
          "endEditing@field": 1,
          "focus@outside": 1
        },
        "scroll_offset": {},
        "keyboard_focus": {
          "target": "outside",
          "ring": true
        },
        "scrollbars": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Shift+Tab: the sheet's button",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          42,
          15
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "react": {
          "blur@outside": 1,
          "focus@sheet": 1
        },
        "scroll_offset": {},
        "keyboard_focus": {
          "target": "sheet",
          "ring": true
        },
        "scrollbars": {}
      }
    },
